@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DFF1EF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AAEB7
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #7B919E
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title SB-M04 — Selected protected retrieval and unavailable variants
actor "Employer viewer" as U
participant "Protected employer link" as L
participant "Published presentation" as P
participant "Requested evidence / PDF" as A
U -> L : Open link; supply required password
L -> L : Evaluate current access and intended scope
alt Invalid password or ineligible link
 L --> U : Denied; no protected content
else Eligible sharing context
 U -> L : Request page, evidence or PDF variant
 L -> P : Resolve intended selected published context
 P -> A : Evaluate resource selection, authority and availability
 alt Outside scope or current access denied
  A --> U : Denied; no unrelated disclosure
 else Requested language / artifact unavailable
  A --> U : Explicit unavailable / processing / failed state
 else Permitted available content
  A --> U : Only requested permitted content
 end
end
note over L,A
Direct file requests require the same applicable checks.
A password is not verified employer identity.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
